<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφοδ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go the rounds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.3.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				80.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώδωνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>visit, inspect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. φυλακάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				6.35.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					13.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					731.16
				</span></i>
			 (Tomi, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὅπλα καὶ τὰ τείχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.781d
				</span></i>
			; <i>make a tour of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μαγειρεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					6.9
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>make a tour of inspection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.6.16
			</span></i>; of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικονόμος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Timocl.
				32.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφοδεύεται</span>
			<i>the rounds are made</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1160
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rarely c.
			dat., <i>superintend, watch over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγῶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					728
				</span></i>
			 (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>visit as a spy, spy out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>, al.: metaph., of a geographer, <i>explore</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.6.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.1.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιγεγραμμένων τῶν μεταρσίων
					ἐφοδευθήσεται καὶ τὰ πρόσγεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					3.8.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> metaph., of
			reasoning, <i>carry on methodically</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.222
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.
			</span></i> Tyr.<i><span class="en">
				16.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
